1
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:03,847
Rook and Shade, against Bolt and Anchor.

2
00:00:05,050 --> 00:00:08,373
Blue presses forward. Red has to find the angle.

3
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:15,568
Shade pulls away. Rook comes across to cover!

4
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:20,759
Anchor is chasing Shade. Look behind him: here comes Rook!

5
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:25,564
Rook keeps coming from the side. Blue has to turn.

6
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:33,244
Anchor loses the edge. Watch Rook keep his feet inside.

7
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:37,904
Bolt is up. Rook changes targets!

8
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:42,603
From the open side. Rook makes contact, then stays inside.

9
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:46,647
Red team wins!
